OL,3,ATrump criticises AI boss who called for
OL,4,Aslowdown and says only guardrail needed
OL,5,Ais a 'smart president'
OL,6,
OL,7,FUS President Donald Trump has
OL,8,Fcriticised the head of AI company
OL,9,FAnthropic, Dario Amodei, after he
OL,10,Fcalled for a slowdown in development of
OL,11,Fthe technology
OL,13,FIn a post on Truth Social, Trump says
OL,14,Fthere is "a SICK conspiracy going on
OL,15,Fagainst AI and Data Centers" and the
OL,16,F"only control or 'guardrails' that AI
OL,17,Fneeds is a STRONG AND SMART PRESIDENT"
OL,18,F- his comments in full
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
