OL,3,ATrump criticises AI boss who called for
OL,4,Aslowdown and says only guardrail needed
OL,5,Ais a 'smart president'
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt comes as tech stocks in Asia, Europe
OL,8,Fand the US fall after the bosses of two
OL,9,Fmajor AI companies backed Amodei's call
OL,10,Fto closely monitor development "to
OL,11,Freduce the risk that something goes
OL,12,Fseriously wrong"
OL,14,FGrok founder Elon Musk said Amodoei was
OL,15,F"right", while OpenAI CEO Sam Altman
OL,16,Fsaid standards are "not at a place" to
OL,17,Fpush AI capabilities much further
OL,19,FIf American AI firms slow down, China
OL,20,Fcould catch up, writes our China
OL,21,Fcorrespondent
